autoware-localrepo-1-9-0 (1.9.0-2ubuntu2204cpu) jammy; urgency=medium

  * setup-prerequisites.sh installs the CUDA 12.8 runtime
    (cuda-cudart-12-8) and the 12.8 math libraries, and cuDNN 9 for CUDA 12,
    which the packages are built with. 1.9.0-1 installed the CUDA 12.4 math
    libraries and cuDNN 8.9 without the runtime, so on a machine without
    CUDA its GPU nodes could not load libcudart.so.12.

